\">trsm</a> <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo.upper\">Uplo.upper</a> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">B</span>)</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">t</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSub.hSub\">-</a> <span class=\"fn\">t</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a>)</span>\n        (<span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">B</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">j</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a>))</span>\n      <span class=\"fn\">A</span><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">[</a><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">(</a><span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">,</a> <span class=\"fn\">i</span><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod.mk\">)</a><a href=\"./Init/GetElem.html#GetElem.getElem\">]</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Element `(i, j)` of `X = trsm .upper d α A B` is `0` when `α = 0`, and otherwise `α * B[i, j]`,\nminus the terms `X[l, j] * A[i, l]` for `l = m - 1, …, i + 1`, divided by `A[i, i]` unless the\ndiagonal is unit: back substitution, in the order of the loops.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.getElem_trsm_upper","kind":"theorem","line":1013,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.getElem_trsm_upper","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Trsm.lean#L1013-L1036"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.getElem_trsm_lower\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">getElem_trsm_lower</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Diag\">Diag</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</spa