o":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.off_trsm","kind":"theorem","line":977,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.off_trsm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Trsm.lean#L977-L978"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.data_trsm\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">data_trsm</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Diag\">Diag</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.trsm\">trsm</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">B</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.data\">data</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.mapMat\">mapMat</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">B</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.data\">data</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">B</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.off\">off</a></span> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">B</span>.<a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.ld\">ld</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">fun (<span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) (<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>) =&gt; <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.trsmAt\">trsmAt</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">B</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span></span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The array of `trsm uplo d α A B` is the array of `B` with its elements solved.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.data_trsm","kind":"theorem","line":971,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.data_trsm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Trsm.lean#L971-L975"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.trsm\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">trsm</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Diag\">Diag</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`trsm uplo d α A B` solves `A * X = α * B` for the triangle `uplo` of `A`, with a unit diagonal if\n`d` is `.unit`, over `B`, by the loops of the reference BLAS: for each column `j` of `B`, it scales\nthe column by `α`, then solves it by the loops of `trsv`. It solves four columns at a time, which\nshare the reads of `A`, with the same operations on each element. It updates `B` in place when its\narray is not shared, and leaves the elements of the array outside `B` unchanged. As in the\nreference BLAS, it sets `B` to `0` without reading `A` or `B` when `α = 0`, reads only the triangle\n`uplo` of `A`, and not its diagonal when `d` is `.unit`, and doesn't check for a zero on the\ndiagonal.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.trsm","kind":"def","line":953,"name":"BLAS.Float32.Mat.trsm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Trsm.lean#L953-L969"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.trsmData_eq\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">trsmData_eq</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Diag\">Diag</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.trsmData\">trsmData</a> <span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> <span class=\"fn\">d</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <s