github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Trsm.lean#L111-L125"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsm.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat.trsmAt\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">Mat</span>.<span class=\"name\">trsmAt</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m </span><span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">uplo</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Uplo\">Uplo</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">d</span> : <a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Trsv.html#BLAS.Float32.Diag\">Diag</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">B</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Mat.html#BLAS.Float32.Mat\">Mat</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i </span><span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The value of `trsm` at `(i, j)`: `0` when `α = 0`, and element `i` of the solution of\n`A * y = α * B[:, j]` by